          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocwa rik te loyo lobo luŋ kittono, lobo obedo kidikidi, kede Negeb, lobo i piny kede lobo otiŋere malo, karacel kede rwodegi luŋ; mom oweko moro odoŋ, ento orweo jami ame iye luŋ aluŋa, kite ame Rwot Obaŋa a jo Icrael onwoŋo ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocwa oloogi cakere i Kadec-barnea tuno kede naka i Gaja, kede i lobo me Gocen luŋ tuno kede i Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocwa omako rwodegi luŋ karacel kede lobogi daŋ, pien Rwot Obaŋa a jo Icrael olwenyo pi jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icennere Yocwa te dwogo doŋ i gony ame tye i Gilgal karacel i jo Icrael luŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
